---
import SiteHeader from "./SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "./SiteFooter.astro";
---

<SiteHeader />

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>EMSA-Approved · California</div>
    <h1>Preventive Health &amp; Safety training, built for your schedule.</h1>
    <p class="sub">
      Two evening sessions. Fully online. One certificate that gets you licensed.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/preventative-health-and-safety-training" class="btn btn-accent"
        >Register Now</a
      >
      <a href="/preventative-health-and-safety-training" class="btn btn-outline"
        >View Upcoming Dates</a
      >
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">
      Certificate provided upon completion — printed &amp; mailed, or digital on request.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="mockup-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="device">
      <div class="device-screen">
        <div class="device-head">
          <h3>Preventive Health &amp; Safety — Next Session</h3>
          <span>8 hours total</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cal-grid">
          <div class="cal-cell active">
            <div class="day">MON</div><div class="time">6–10 PM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-cell active">
            <div class="day">TUE</div><div class="time">6–10 PM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-cell"><div class="day">WED</div><div class="time">—</div></div>
          <div class="cal-cell"><div class="day">THU</div><div class="time">—</div></div>
          <div class="cal-cell"><div class="day">FRI</div><div class="time">—</div></div>
          <div class="cal-cell"><div class="day">SAT</div><div class="time">—</div></div>
          <div class="cal-cell"><div class="day">SUN</div><div class="time">—</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="device-foot">
          <div>
            <div class="label">Format</div>
            <div class="value">Online, live</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="label">Tuition</div>
            <div class="value">$80</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="label">Certificate</div>
            <div class="value">Included</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="feature" id="why">
  <div class="wrap feature-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Two evenings. Not one long day.</h2>
      <p>
        The full 8-hour requirement, split into two 4-hour sessions — Monday and Tuesday, 6 to
        10 PM — so it fits around a working schedule instead of taking over a whole Saturday.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="34" stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
        <line x1="50" y1="50" x2="50" y2="30" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line>
        <line x1="50" y1="50" x2="64" y2="58" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature gray">
  <div class="wrap feature-grid reverse">
    <div class="feature-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect x="20" y="24" width="60" height="42" rx="4" stroke-width="2.5"></rect>
        <path d="M20 60h60" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
        <path d="M42 76h16" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
        <path d="M50 66v10" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Fully virtual, built for California providers</h2>
      <p>
        Attend from home over Zoom — no commute, no classroom to find. Every detail of the
        course, from pacing to content, is built specifically around California child care
        licensing requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature">
  <div class="wrap feature-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Taught by someone who's done the work</h2>
      <p>
        Miss Judith is a Registered Nurse with real-world health and safety experience — not a
        script. Every class includes hands-on scenarios and personal attention.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="50" cy="38" r="16" stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
        <path d="M22 82c0-16 12-26 28-26s28 10 28 26" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="checklist-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="checklist-head">
      <h2>Everything else you get</h2>
      <p>The rest of what's included with every class.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="checklist-grid">
      <div class="check-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path d="M8 13.5 4.5 10l-1.4 1.4L8 16.3l9-9-1.4-1.4z"></path></svg
        >
        <span>EMSA-approved Preventive Health &amp; Safety training</span>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path d="M8 13.5 4.5 10l-1.4 1.4L8 16.3l9-9-1.4-1.4z"></path></svg
        >
        <span>Convenient evening schedule</span>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path d="M8 13.5 4.5 10l-1.4 1.4L8 16.3l9-9-1.4-1.4z"></path></svg
        >
        <span>Certificate provided upon completion</span>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path d="M8 13.5 4.5 10l-1.4 1.4L8 16.3l9-9-1.4-1.4z"></path></svg
        >
        <span>Printed certificate mailed directly to you</span>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path d="M8 13.5 4.5 10l-1.4 1.4L8 16.3l9-9-1.4-1.4z"></path></svg
        >
        <span>Digital certificate available upon request</span>
      </div>
      <div class="check-item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          ><path d="M8 13.5 4.5 10l-1.4 1.4L8 16.3l9-9-1.4-1.4z"></path></svg
        >
        <span>Practical information for your child care program</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="serve" id="courses">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="serve-head">
      <h2>Built for anyone who cares for others</h2>
      <p>
        Designed for anyone responsible for the safety and well-being of the people around them.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="serve-row">
      <span class="serve-chip">Daycares &amp; Childcare Centers</span>
      <span class="serve-chip">Schools &amp; Educators</span>
      <span class="serve-chip">Parents &amp; Caregivers</span>
      <span class="serve-chip">Coaches &amp; Youth Leaders</span>
      <span class="serve-chip">Businesses &amp; Workplaces</span>
      <span class="serve-chip">Community Organizations</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="instructor">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="avatar">MJ</div>
    <h3>Miss Judith</h3>
    <div class="role">Lead Safety Instructor · Los Angeles, CA</div>
    <div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>

    <div class="quotes">
      <div class="quote">
        <p>
          "Miss Judith was a fantastic instructor for our Preventive Health and Safety training.
          She was knowledgeable, patient, and made EMSA requirements easy to understand. Her
          hands-on approach helped us feel confident running a safe childcare program."
        </p>
        <div class="attr">— Dean B., verified student</div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">
        <p>
          "Knowledgeable, patient, and made the material easy to understand. Her hands-on
          approach helped us feel truly confident."
        </p>
        <div class="attr">— Verified student review</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="closing">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Ready to get licensed and certified?</h2>
    <p>
      Join the next class and get the training California child care providers need. Only $80 per
      person — all materials included.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/preventative-health-and-safety-training" class="btn btn-accent"
        >Register Now</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-head"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2></div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details open>
        <summary>How long is the course?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
        <p>
          The full certification is 8 hours total, held over two sessions: Monday and Tuesday
          evenings from 6:00 PM to 10:00 PM.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How much does training cost?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
        <p>Tuition is $80 per person and includes all required training content.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is this EMSA-approved?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
        <p>
          Yes. This Preventive Health and Safety class is EMSA-approved and accepted for
          qualifying childcare providers in California.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I get my Zoom class links?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
        <p>
          After payment, your Zoom links are emailed instantly for both session nights. If you
          don't see it, check your spam folder.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do I need to attend both sessions?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
        <p>
          Yes. Monday and Tuesday are a paired class week, and both sessions are required to
          complete the full 8-hour training.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Who do I contact for help?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
        <p>Call 323-921-6244 or email info@alerttrainingservices.com.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<SiteFooter />
